=== Imaging Centre Wandegeye (Java Backend + MongoDB) ===
MongoDB : mongodb://localhost:27017/hms
API     : http://localhost:8080/hms/api
Endpoints:
  POST /auth/login   | GET /auth/me      - staff & admin login/session
  POST /auth/register                    - create worker account [admin]
  POST /auth/logout                       - logout (invalidates token)
  GET  /admin/dashboard                   - admin stats [admin]
  GET/POST /admin/users | DELETE /admin/users/{id} - admin users [admin]
  GET  /patients   | POST /patients       - patient registration
  GET  /patients/{id}                     - patient detail
  POST /opd          | GET /opd           - OPD consultation
  POST /admissions   | GET /admissions    - admission
  POST /stays        | GET /stays         - hospital stay
  POST /discharges   | GET /discharges    - discharge
  POST /certificates | GET /certificates  - issue certificates
  POST /forms        | GET /forms         - issue forms
  POST /labs         | GET /labs          - lab results
  POST /payroll      | GET /payroll       - payroll
  GET/POST /config                        - system configuration
  GET  /reports                           - reports
Admin login:    admin / admin123
Worker login:   worker / worker123 (also: doctor/labtech)
Press Ctrl+C to stop.
